[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3509857387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111709#issuecomment-3509857387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111709","id":3509857387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RNCxr","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-10T07:30:03Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T07:30:03Z","body":"I think we were changing this back and forth multiple times, and neither option works for everyone.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3509857387/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3510125257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111709#issuecomment-3510125257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111709","id":3510125257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ROELJ","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-10T08:26:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T08:26:57Z","body":"> I think we were changing this back and forth multiple times, and neither option works for everyone.\r\n\r\nHmm, I'm trying to figure out why this could be. I know for a fact that Apple changed their default naming for the signing identities, which may have messed things up. Or maybe people didn't have Xcode automatically set up the provisioning profiles.\r\n\r\n[This page](https://developer.apple.com/help/account/certificates/certificates-overview/) has an overview of all the signing identities. `Apple Development` is for running on a local device, `Apple Distribution` for putting it on the App Store.\r\n\r\nHere's the kicker, I think: to run the app on a local device, you **need** `Apple Development`, regardless of whether you're running the Debug or Release scheme in Xcode. This is why it makes sense that both the Debug and the Release scheme in Xcode are set to `Apple Development` **in combination with automatic signing**; because when you archive & send the app to the App Store for distribution, Xcode will resign it with `Apple Distribution`. That's the magic of auto signing that this PR is trying to enable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3510125257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4915734657","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111709#issuecomment-4915734657","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111709","id":4915734657,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJQAogQ","user":{"login":"Urielbp","id":29117190,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTE3MTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29117190?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp","html_url":"https://github.com/Urielbp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Urielbp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T14:15:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T14:18:14Z","body":"Just confirmed the bug is still happening in Godot 4.7 and the suggested fix works.\r\nIt should help reduce the initial setup needed for an iOS export to work.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://a